# Direct dependencies that modrot flags as stale but that we keep on
# purpose. Each entry carries a dated reason on the line above it; an
# inline comment after the module path would stop the entry matching.
# Re-check any entry once its date is more than a year old.

# 2026-09-30 keep: latest tag, same pin as spruce and bosh-cli, and
# patch.Ops is part of graft's public API, so vendoring is deferred.
github.com/cppforlife/go-patch

# 2026-09-30 keep: newest commit (only v1.0.0 was ever tagged), dyff and
# testify require it, and go-udiff's diff cap degrades large YAML diffs.
github.com/pmezard/go-difflib

# 2026-09-30 keep: latest tag with no successor; it backs 63 test files,
# and a move to testify is a separate refactor.
github.com/smartystreets/goconvey
